<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reviews | Clinic Appointment System</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111; }
        /* Navbar styling remains exactly the same */
        .navbar { padding: 20px 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; background-color: #fff; }
        .navbar-brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.6rem; color: #000 !important; }
        .nav-link { color: #000; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; }
        .nav-link:hover { color: #555; }
        .nav-icons i { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #000; cursor: pointer; }

        .page-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 80px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
        .review-card { background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 30px; padding: 40px; height: 100%; transition: transform 0.3s ease; border: 1px solid transparent; }
        .review-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: #D6CCC2; }
        
        .stars i { color: #D6CCC2; font-size: 1.2rem; }
        .review-text { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; font-style: italic; margin: 20px 0; }
        .reviewer-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .reviewer-title { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888; }
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/clinic-theme.css">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVIGATION BAR -->
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <!-- REVIEWS CONTENT -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold" style="font-size: 2.5rem;">Experiences of Excellence.</h2>
            <p class="text-muted mt-3">Discreet reflections from our esteemed clientele.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <!-- Review 1 -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="review-card">
                    <div class="stars">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="review-text">"The level of personalized attention is unparalleled. From the secure entry to the comprehensive post-consultation follow-ups, they understand the value of my time and privacy perfectly."</p>
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <p class="reviewer-name mb-0">E. R.</p>
                        <p class="reviewer-title">Executive Director</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Review 2 -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="review-card">
                    <div class="stars">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="review-text">"An absolute paradigm shift in medical care. The bespoke health mapping provided by Dr. Tan gave me insights I simply could not find anywhere else in the world."</p>
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <p class="reviewer-name mb-0">Jonathan M.</p>
                        <p class="reviewer-title">Private Patient</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Review 3 -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="review-card">
                    <div class="stars">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="review-text">"The facilities are identical to a five-star hotel, yet the medical technology is state-of-the-art. The concierge team handles everything flawlessly."</p>
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <p class="reviewer-name mb-0">S. W. Lee</p>
                        <p class="reviewer-title">Global Entrepreneur</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Review 4 -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="review-card">
                    <div class="stars">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="review-text">"I fly into Singapore specifically for my annual assessments here. The discretion, the elite specialists, and the seamless logistics make it the only clinic I trust."</p>
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <p class="reviewer-name mb-0">A. K.</p>
                        <p class="reviewer-title">International Client</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>